OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to buy homes for homeless and
OL,4,Acut hotel use
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city council is looking to buy
OL,7,Fproperties for homeless people to
OL,8,Fprevent a reliance on hotels.
OL,10,FCity of Lincoln Council spends #500,000
OL,11,Feach year on bed-and-breakfasts, hotels
OL,12,Fand other short-term accommodations to
OL,13,Fprovide shelter for people who are
OL,14,Fhomeless.
OL,16,FThe new homelessness action plan, which
OL,17,Fwould involve buying properties and
OL,18,Fcommissioning it from other services,
OL,19,Fwas discussed at an executive meeting
OL,20,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
